<title>UK: Utd News Stevens to be part-time chairman.</title>
<headline>Utd News Stevens to be part-time chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>United News &amp; Media Plc on Wednesday confirmed that Lord Stevens would move from the role of full-time to part-time chairman after the company's annual general meeting next May.</p>
</text>
